WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:10.427
Donna: Something creepy is
going on

00:00:10.427 --> 00:00:11.594
We all see it.

00:00:11.594 --> 00:00:12.220
Ruben: Woah.

00:00:13.179 --> 00:00:13.888
It's a ghost.

00:00:15.598 --> 00:00:16.975
Ruben: A ghost... writer?

00:00:18.268 --> 00:00:19.561
Ruben: It's not easy
being the new kid.

00:00:20.478 --> 00:00:22.272
The menu board says-
-Come together.

00:00:22.814 --> 00:00:23.523
Curtis: Ever since you 
moved here,

00:00:23.523 --> 00:00:24.816
we're seeing these
bizarre messages.

00:00:25.525 --> 00:00:27.068
This never happened
at my old school.

00:00:27.068 --> 00:00:28.068
I'm pretty sure it's

00:00:28.068 --> 00:00:29.654
never happened at any school.

00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:33.491
Ruben: Alice's Adventures
in Wonderland.

00:00:35.493 --> 00:00:36.077
Chantal: The ghost writer let

00:00:36.077 --> 00:00:37.078
the characters out of the book.

00:00:37.787 --> 00:00:38.455
Ruben: The Mad Hatter.

00:00:38.997 --> 00:00:39.706
Donna: Alice.

00:00:40.081 --> 00:00:40.582
Donna: The rabbit.

00:00:40.582 --> 00:00:42.625
That's Mr. W. Rabbit to you.

00:00:43.126 --> 00:00:43.752
Rabbit: What is this?

00:00:44.044 --> 00:00:44.794
What are you doing?

00:00:44.794 --> 00:00:45.794
Ugh. Horrifying.

00:00:48.423 --> 00:00:49.174
Ruben: Look.

00:00:50.592 --> 00:00:51.634
Donna: Moguli,

00:00:51.634 --> 00:00:52.427
from the Jungle Book.

00:00:52.427 --> 00:00:53.427
Ruben: Why did the ghost writer

00:00:53.427 --> 00:00:54.427
release these characters?

00:00:54.427 --> 00:00:55.638
Find the book and read it.

00:00:55.722 --> 00:00:56.347
That's the only way we're

00:00:56.347 --> 00:00:57.347
going to solve this mystery.

00:00:57.932 --> 00:00:59.225
Pigeon: Do you have
anything to eat?

00:00:59.517 --> 00:01:00.018
Nope.

00:01:00.018 --> 00:01:01.728
So now we can
hear animals talking.

00:01:01.728 --> 00:01:03.188
Where is my dinner?

00:01:03.188 --> 00:01:05.523
I have grown tired of
the cheap kibble.

00:01:06.399 --> 00:01:07.400
Donna: Ghosts only hang around

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:09.652
Donna: when they have some sort
of unfinished business

00:01:09.652 --> 00:01:11.654
There's something bigger.
A real secret.

00:01:21.206 --> 00:01:21.664
Run!

00:01:23.917 --> 00:01:26.044
You are quite a small cat.

00:01:26.044 --> 00:01:28.463
What I lack in size,
I make up for in charm.

00:01:37.138 --> 00:01:38.389
Ghost writer!

00:01:38.389 --> 00:01:39.766
Donna: Can you hear us?

00:01:39.766 --> 00:01:40.141
Ay!

00:01:40.141 --> 00:01:40.809
Hey!

00:01:40.975 --> 00:01:42.060
The whole city can.

00:01:44.771 --> 00:01:45.688
Super cool.

00:01:46.523 --> 00:01:48.483
You have no idea.

